ut.** A `dlopen`/`dlsym` harness ran both `.so` files: stdout hexdumps match exactly (`4865 6c6c 6f20 576f 726c 6421 0a`), `cmp` clean, return value `0` in both.\n4. **Interleaving parity.** Second harness printing `\"BEFORE:\"` (no newline, left in the shared stdio buffer) around the call: both produce `BEFORE:Hello World!\\nAFTER\\n` byte-for-byte — confirming the shared-buffer behavior.\n5. **`c_src/` untouched** — mtimes still the original `15:41:48`; the C build was done out-of-tree in `$TMPDIR`.\n\nNo sub-agents were needed; the library was small enough (1 translation unit, 1 symbol) that delegation would have added risk without benefit."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1028,"cache_read_input_tokens":24720,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1028,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05280e0e-0db6-4adb-b5a5-e546b642533e","uuid":"c32eed44-64b2-4092-bcdc-36fd4d6ec91d","timestamp":"2026-08-17T15:43:41.316Z"}
